write(OUT/'README.md',b'''# CLOUD-059 v7 diagnostics and failed installed terminal attempt6\n\n**C054 terminal acceptance remains failed.** Exact product/package and utility helpers: edd0cb121ff6847f681ab6bf41509a497f043d41. New helper v7 adds passive diagnostics only. Other later repository changes are not executed by this package.\n\nThe actual shell printed FIRST and sent native typed exit0, then Chromium reported a socket error and unclean1006. The original primary assertion and held-response state are preserved. No UI Restart, second nonzero exit or full terminal pass occurred. The controller's private INFO log classified one relay termination as1000; that does not prove direction or successful browser closure. CDP recorded no extensions and no opcode8 close frames, with one26-byte unclassified error hash. Both browser error projections discarded unknown text. That diagnostic gap is explicit: no original string is reconstructed here, and no cause is asserted.\n\nRaw private stderr remains excluded. Its exact2039-byte held file matches the complete observed-stream and prefix hashes in the original result. The16KiB line parser/256KiB private prefix bounds were not exceeded. The private module's17 inert controls and final32 selected transport/route/monitor/wiring controls are separate from this failed installed run; prior7/8/29 counts overlap. A receipt-parser formatting failure is retained without turning it into a test failure. Source controls are not live logging/terminal acceptance.\n\nSupported Stop returned200. The independent closure retains empty selected Docker/volumes/ledger,31 unchanged private fixture files, exact launcher/controller/main-browser absence and two Chromium PID1 zombies. No whole-machine or zero-process claim is made. Earlier attempts1-5 and the attempt3 charged fixture are unchanged and separate.\n\nThe original result, phase receipts, wrapper, exact accepted sources, screenshot and independent closure are retrievable here. The screenshot shows disposable fixture terminal text and ended footer; it is not an alternative to missing protocol evidence. Package binaries/image layers/private state/log bytes are not exported. Original versus transformed hashes are declared in original-bindings.json. No unused application workloads or unchanged product suites were rerun to publish these files.\n\nUse python3 verify.py for receipt verification only. To reproduce inert controls, run node --test --test-concurrency=1 over controls/installed-v7/{transport,scenario,route-settlement,gate-budget,wiring}.test.mjs and separately controls/v7-log-capture/controller-log-capture.test.mjs. They use fake streams/VM callbacks/private temporary files only. Do not run archived launch/cleanup commands against retained fixtures or a shared daemon. No actual runtime is launched by verification.\n\nControlled full-path C054 Go triage is published separately under cloud054-close-triage-20261009. Its normal1000 result does not override this browser failure.\n''')
